: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971600/extras/e96b95d848d2df0e815312f3f1f83149.avif?t=1758011046\" width=96 height=76 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Vast World:</strong> Explore over 600 unique locations, from cozy school classrooms to mysterious ancient ruins and their inhabitants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Full of Life:</strong> Constant hustle and bustle in the school hallways and epic snowball fights that spare no one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Trials:</strong> Battle 150+ types of enemies and defeat 11 legendary bosses in the Colosseum to prove your title of Invincible Gladiator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Stories:</strong> Uncover 50 different stories and solve a sea of puzzles on your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Way Out:</strong> Make it to the very end and prove that you are ready to step into adult life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Challenge:</strong> Do you dare to face the FIRST GLADIATOR, the one who is absolutely INVINCIBLE? Can you find a way to defeat the undefeatable?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P.S. If anyone can beat him, send me a video of the fight!</strong></p>","developers":["Mergi1"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971600/c54918a7d193d75d9015aabb915d8097c13d7215/header.jpg?t=1758011046","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3971600/1685748538/a7ab7d5b9244647009ec1befff440aef99d145d3/1755659357/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756810958